.page-section.p-120-cont.cg-section.clearfix(id="outcomes-link")
    .container
        .row
            .col-md-10.col-md-offset-1.text-center.mb-60
                h2.cg-section-title Outcomes we target
                p.cg-section-lead Engineering-led engagements with measurable infrastructure results.
        .row
            .col-md-6
                .cg-outcome-card.wow.fadeIn
                    h3 20–40% AWS cost reduction
                    p After audit and remediation: rightsizing, Lambda and API Gateway tuning, caching, and cutting redundant spend—not generic “finops slides.”
            .col-md-6
                .cg-outcome-card.wow.fadeIn(data-wow-delay='100ms')
                    h3 2x–5x faster API paths
                    p Latency improvements from profiling Go services, fixing N+1 and IO patterns, queues, and concurrency—validated against production-like load.
            .col-md-6
                .cg-outcome-card.wow.fadeIn(data-wow-delay='200ms')
                    h3 Stability under production load
                    p Fewer incidents from timeouts and overload when backpressure, limits, and failure domains are designed in—not bolted on after an outage.
            .col-md-6
                .cg-outcome-card.wow.fadeIn(data-wow-delay='300ms')
                    h3 Faster, safer deploy cycles
                    p Serverless and event-driven boundaries reduce operational drag so teams ship smaller changes with less risk.
